## The Relighting's claims: what the finished story can reach, each under
## the rooms, things and verbs that are load-bearing on the way. The test
## tree's manifest names this file; the story never imports it. The shared
## set is the way to the roof; a claim that needs more or less declares
## its own.

claims
  needs rooms: the Lodge, the Gate Court, the Cloister, the Library, the Undercroft, the Refectory, the Bell Stair, the Lantern Gallery
  needs things: the hand lamp, the oak press, the library key, the library door, the kindle page, the cistern, the mend page, the crate, the lens, the book hoist, Hobb, the newspapers, the hush page, Tamsin Vey, the unbind page, the tower bell, the iron grille, the Great Lantern, the shutter crank, the shutter
  needs verbs: take, open, unlock, read, kindle, z, x, mend, put, ask, say, hush, unbind, turn

  claim the story can be won
    the story ends in victory
    needs rooms: the Lodge, the Gate Court, the Cloister, the Library, the Undercroft, the Refectory, the Bell Stair, the Lantern Gallery, the Water Stair, the Beacon Isle
    needs things: the hand lamp, the oak press, the library key, the library door, the kindle page, the cistern, the mend page, the crate, the lens, the book hoist, Hobb, the newspapers, the hush page, Tamsin Vey, the unbind page, the tower bell, the iron grille, the Great Lantern, the shutter crank, the shutter, the Heron, the beacon
    needs verbs: take, open, unlock, read, kindle, z, x, mend, put, ask, say, hush, unbind, turn, enter, steer east, make sail, exit

  claim the Hall can be woken
    the story is awake

  claim a cracked lens ends the story
    the story ends in defeat
    needs verbs: take, open, unlock, read, kindle, z, x, put, ask, say, hush, unbind, turn

  claim the ward on the stair can be lifted
    the iron grille is lifted
    needs rooms: the Lodge, the Gate Court, the Cloister, the Library, the Undercroft, the Bell Stair
    needs things: the hand lamp, the oak press, the library key, the library door, the kindle page, Hobb, the newspapers, the hush page, Tamsin Vey, the unbind page, the tower bell, the iron grille
    needs verbs: take, open, unlock, read, kindle, z, x, ask, say, hush, unbind
end claims
